// Plotted is a state of a card in exile: "It becomes a plotted card"
// [CR#702.170a], and some spells and abilities cause a card in exile to become
// plotted [CR#702.170c]; its owner may cast it on a later turn [CR#702.170d].
// The plot keyword's grammar owns the "plotted" adjective, so this declaration
// writes none.
Designation(
    name: "plotted",
    params: [],
    spelling: "plotted",
    scope: HeldBy(Object),
    effectful: true,
    zone: Exile,
)
